# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: Prove Your Worth (421), Raleigh and the Undercity (441), Prompt Potion Runner (97891),
# Zinge's Delivery and Sample for Helbrim (1359, 1358), The Spirits of Stonetalon (1061), and for
# the starts that come by zeppelin, The Argent Emissary, The Cult of the Damned, Remnants of War and
# Delivery to Silverpine Forest (96895, 96897, 96898, 445).

# Horde 12-30 in the order the quest levels fit (2026-11-07): Silverpine Forest comes first, at
# 12-15, straight from every start. Tirisfal Glades walks south into it; Durotar, Mulgore and
# Zephras Isle come by Orgrimmar and the zeppelin. The Barrens and Stonetalon follow at 15-21 in
# forever/horde/02-the-barrens, which starts where this guide ends, in Orgrimmar.
#
# Flow: Orgrimmar (flight path, the starts' hand-ins, training) -> zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades ->
# Brill (Terrence, Johaan) and Hadric's cultists by the zeppelin towers ->
# the Sepulcher (flight path, bind) -> the Dalaran crate and back -> north loop: the Dead Field,
# Malden's Orchard, Erland's escort, worg hearts -> the Sepulcher -> north again: Valgan's Field,
# Quinn, the murloc eyes on the shore -> south along the lake shore past the Decrepit Ferry to
# Ambermill -> the Sepulcher -> Quinn and Ivar the Foul on the road north -> Brill ->
# the Undercity (flight path; Raleigh, Zinge) -> zeppelin to Orgrimmar: the city's own
# quests, training. The guide ends in the Valley of Wisdom.
#
# Silverpine's level-20 quests wait for the ride through the forest to Hillsbrad at about 22
# (forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains): Beren's Peril (516) and Watching the Roads (95981) with
# the Offering Stone; Journey to Hillsbrad Foothills (493, from level 19) is taken on that ride's
# Sepulcher stop. Mura Runetotem (3301, a level 15 delivery from the Crossroads to the Sepulcher) is
# left out: the route reaches the Sepulcher from the Crossroads only at 22, when it is grey.
#
# Left out at 12-15: Rot Hide Ichor (443, level 17) and the Fenris Isle extras (460, 461): the island's
# Rot Hide gnolls are 15-17 and Fenris Keep's 18-22, three to five levels above the player here.
#
# Left out: the Forever Arugal's Folly (98298): Dalar offers it only after
# the Classic Arugal's Folly series (421-424, 99; Forever's quest chain
# data, #51), which the route does not run past its first part. Stop the Spread (98299, Forever):
# Dalar did not offer it to an Undead at 19 (#161) or a Tauren at 21 (#229)
# on this route, though the data gives it to every Horde race from level 9
# with no prerequisite; one player's report asks for the quest before
# it. Its refugees step goes with it.
#
# Quinn's potions run Wild Hearts (429) -> Return to Quinn (430) -> Wild Eyes
# (91920, Forever) -> Return to Quinn (Again) (91921, Forever): Forever's quest
# chain data (checked 2026-10-17), and the texts agree (Wild Eyes opens "the potion made no
# noticeable difference", 91921 brings "the new potion"). Wild Eyes is taken from Quinn when 430
# is handed in at the Yoricks' house, its murlocs line the shore walk south, and
# Renferrel takes it at the Sepulcher after the island. On Forever, Ivar the Foul (425) opens only
# once Return to Quinn (Again) is handed in (players' reports on 425 and 91921, #51), so both are
# done at the Yoricks' house on the road north out of the forest at the end.
#
# Skyborne: Welcome to Azeroth (95350) is turned in to Thrall in Grommash Hold on arrival in
# Orgrimmar, with Exploring the Horde (93739, Forever, Skyborne only) taken there; Journey to the
# Crossroads (98024) comes from Thrall when the guide is back in the Valley of Wisdom at the end.
# Nazgrel and Vol'jin stand in Grommash Hold, Sylvanas is visited on this guide's Undercity stop,
# Cairne on the Thunder Bluff stop of forever/horde/07-ashenvale, and Thrall takes it back on the
# Orgrimmar stop of the 30-40 guides. It is optional throughout: a tour for 1150 XP.
#
# Dropped: A Recipe For Death (447): its Skittering Blood comes only from the
# spiders in the north-west hills, off every walk. Rot Hide Origins (444) and Hidden Enemies
# (5726): the route never turns them in. Wand to Bethor (491): its turn-in comes at level 56.
# The Weaver (480): it opens only once Ambermill Investigations (479) is handed in, after the
# Ambermill loop, so it needs a second walk back to Ambermill, and Archmage Ataeric is level 22
# among the Dalaran casters in the middle of the town.
# The Engraved Ring (440) stays (Rev17H): Magistrate Sevren is in Brill, on the road from
# Silverpine to the zeppelin towers.
#
# Class quests: Orcs and Trolls hand the cultists' Neeru Fireblade (829) and The Admiral's Orders
# (831) in on arrival in Orgrimmar. Troll Priests hand Hex of Weakness (5654) to Ur'kyo on the
# Orgrimmar training trip of forever/horde/02-the-barrens. Tauren Druids leave the Strange Lockbox
# on the coast west of the Dead Field alone here: its Half Pendant of Aquatic Endurance drops only
# while Trial of the Sea Lion (30, from level 16) is in the log (#1386). They take the quest in
# Moonglade in the next guide and open the lockbox on the ride through Silverpine at 21
# (forever/horde/05-stonetalon-mountains).
#
# Class training: Orgrimmar on arrival at 12 and at the end at 15 for everyone but Druids and
# Paladins (no trainer of theirs there). Paladins train in Brill on the way through Tirisfal Glades
# and with Garen Largo on the Undercity stop at the end; Druids train in Thunder Bluff on the next
# guide's Moonglade trip at 16, not by a trip from Orgrimmar to Thunder Bluff at 15.
# Undead Paladins from 18: Danitha Morr at Bandarion Keep (Tirisfal) starts their Silverpine chain
# (91858-91862, 96204, 95034: the Sepulcher, Fenris Isle, Lumina Windsinger), the Class guide
# forever/class/paladin/lumina-windsinger.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Orgrimmar and the zeppelin

# Orcs, Trolls, Tauren and Skyborne arrive in Orgrimmar from their starts and do the city's own
# quests (level 15, from 5) before the zeppelin, on one walk from the main gate through the Valley of
# Strength, the Drag and the Valley of Honor to the Valley of Wisdom. The Undead walk south from
# Brill, pick the guide up at the Silverpine Forest step below and take the same quests on the
# Orgrimmar stop at the end, where the others find them done.
step Orgrimmar
  only Orc,Troll,Tauren,Skyborne
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Walk in by the main gate. Doras, the wind rider master, stands on the tower in the Valley of Strength; Thatog by the bank below it.
  getfp "Orgrimmar"
  accept 97246                        -- Thatog

step Borstan
  only Orc,Troll,Tauren,Skyborne
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Borstan's Firepit is a few steps north.
  turnin 97246                        -- Borstan
  accept 97249

step Neeru Fireblade
  only Orc,Troll
  zone Orgrimmar
  when onquest 829
  tip The Cleft of Shadow is the canyon under the Valley of Strength; Neeru Fireblade stands at its far end.
  turnin 829
  turnin 832 optional                 -- Neeru Fireblade

step The Drag
  only Orc,Troll,Tauren,Skyborne
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Kor'geld and Yelmak run the alchemy shop in the Drag; Whuut is next door.
  accept 97242                        -- Kor'geld

step Valley of Honor
  only Orc,Troll,Tauren,Skyborne
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip The cattails and speargrass grow along the water in the Valley of Honor, east of the Drag.
  collect 277278 quest 97242.1
  collect 277279 quest 97242.2

step Class trainer
  only Orc,Troll,Tauren,Skyborne,Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Warlock
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Train while you are in the city: Druids and Paladins have no trainer here.
  train class only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Warlock

step Sayoc
  only Orc,Troll,Tauren,Skyborne,Warrior
  zone Orgrimmar
  when money>=10s
  when !skill "Two-Handed Axes" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Two-Handed Axes from Sayoc (Valley of Honor, 10 silver); two-handers level a Warrior fastest.
  train 11868                         -- Sayoc

