# Tirisfal Glades on the way down to Silverpine (Orcs, Trolls, Tauren and Skyborne): Brill, a short walk north of the
# zeppelin towers (Deathguard Terrence, Apothecary Johaan), then Hadric Harlson's Argent chain at Deathguard Linnea's
# camp east of the towers: The Cult of the Damned and Remnants of War (level 12, from 10) on the cultists a short walk
# south-east of him. Delivery to Silverpine Forest (445) goes to Renferrel at the Sepulcher.
