  only Orc,Troll,Tauren,Skyborne
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  tip Brill is a short walk north up the road from the zeppelin towers: Deathguard Terrence stands by the road into town, Apothecary Johaan in the apothecary's house on the west side of the square.
